Billionaire investor Charlie Munger sat down with CNBC’s Becky Quick on November 14, 2023
in Los Angeles, CA in a special interview to commemorate his soon-to-come 100th birthday.
Munger passed away on November 28 at the age of 99. “Charlie Munger: A Life of Wit and
Wisdom” features this recent interview to celebrate Munger’s life and his storied career.
Following is the complete transcript from the special that aired today, Thursday, November 30.
Encore presentations of “Charlie Munger: A Life of Wit and Wisdom” will air on the following
dates and times:
All references must be sourced to CNBC.
